### Artwork & Audio Attribution & Terms of Use

- **Visual Artwork**: The visual artwork in this repository is an edited adaptation of original art created by **[@aruhshura](https://x.com/aruhshura)**, showcased in the video *"don't think about it anymore"* (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A09aumNef-c).
- **Audio / Soundtrack**: The ambient background music is sourced and looped from *"don't think about it anymore"* (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=A09aumNef-c).
- The original artistic and musical rights remain with their respective creators. These media assets are included for personal, non-commercial, and open-source enthusiast use only. Anyone adapting or porting these assets to other wallpaper engines must preserve this attribution.
